/** Mode for trait assignment:
 *  - "fixed": static per-layer values (Narea_*, SLA_*)
 *  - "dynamic_Prieto": Nm(t) decline with thermal time, LMA regression on PPFD
 *  - "dynamic_Bertheloot": placeholder for alternative schemes
 */
